    "summary": "CPRMV v2026.11.0, the first release with a release number: production runs 502a351 and reports release v2026.11.0 beside vocabulary version 0.4.3 on /health, every release commits a CycloneDX bill of materials, and /bump-release cuts a release through acc and main. RONL Business API v2026.11.6 (7416c65): Infra-board tasks can ask for their B and B+ documents from the eDOCS projectmap and refuse completion without them, once the models that declare them are deployed; the Woo-dashboard signs in with the Flevoland account; the backend deploys only from CI.",
